#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:272
msgid "timeline.tables.pauses.help_title"
msgstr "What are on-hold periods?"

#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:272
msgid "timeline.tables.pauses.help_text"
msgstr ""
"On-hold periods represent the time during which the task is put on hold.<br /"
">The <code>Actual time</code> graph shows the total elapsed time between these "
"dates. The <code>Working hours only</code> graph displays the time within "
"standard working hours (Monday to Friday, 9:00–13:00 and 14:00–18:00), excluding "
"holidays.<br /><strong>Note:</strong> a one-second difference between the "
"working time and the actual time may occur due to rounding to minutes."

