#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:309
msgid "timeline.tables.anomalies.help_title"
msgstr "What is an anomaly and which of them are detected?"

#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:309
msgid "timeline.tables.anomalies.help_text"
msgstr ""
"Anomalies are a mechanism for finding typical problems in tasks. At the moment, "
"the following problems may be detected in the tasks:<br />\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Deadline violations</li>\n"
"<li>Too long review by one person (more than two business days)</li>\n"
"<li>Exceeding the Scope of the task</li>\n"
"<li>Increasing the Scope of the task</li>\n"
"</ol>"

