#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:332
msgid "timeline.tables.subtasks.help_title"
msgstr "How do subtasks affect Spent Time?"

#: templates/timeline.html.jinja:332
msgid "timeline.tables.subtasks.help_text"
msgstr ""
"YouTrack automatically adds the <code>Spent Time</code> of each subtask to the "
"total <code>Spent Time</code>. This may make it seem as if the task is delayed, "
"while in fact, the time is recorded separately. The table below displays each "
"subtask (if any), along with its <code>Spent Time</code> and its percentage of "
"the total."

